foufgug27vheULp-FK-7PhSvuw\"/><figcaption>布魯克斯Madison Brooks在社交平台分享的日常相片（Instagram＠madibrookss）</figcaption></figure><p>延伸閲讀：</p><p>有片 /美國大峽谷致命暴洪！2死逾20人失蹤　遊客嚇壞：洪水轟鳴如火車</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T13:24:03.175270+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1411,"images":11,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}